Neither Nanase nor the soldier was there.
All anyone could hear, they say, was a faint, dull clanking coming from the direction of the walkway...{p}

rows.61:43bc:
Nanase...?
Or someone from much longer ago...?
Heh heh, maybe it wasn't only corpses that cart carried.{p}

rows.61:4670:
"Say, {a}.
Would you take everyone and head back to the club room ahead of me?"
"Is something wrong?"{p}

rows.61:52a8:
